{
  "name": "Operating plan proposed, activated, revised and read against both versions",
  "description": "Company operating plan targets sharing a plan label are recorded as proposed (omitted from default lists until activated), activated, revised mid-quarter with a reason while carrying past periods unchanged, and read against both version 1 and the current version.",
